            <div class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom:6px;">보고자: 재무이사</div><p>2026년 한 해 동안의 사업 운영 예산안 승인을 요청드립니다.</p><table><thead><tr><th colspan="3" style="background:#10b981;color:white;text-align:center;">수 입</th><th colspan="3" style="background:#ef4444;color:white;text-align:center;">지 출</th></tr><tr><th>관</th><th>내역</th><th>금액</th><th>관</th><th>내역</th><th>금액</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>회비</td><td>정기회원 100명 × 12개월</td><td style="text-align:right;">12,000,000</td><td>운영비</td><td>회의·사무 지원</td><td style="text-align:right;">4,000,000</td></tr><tr><td>후원금</td><td>기업 후원</td><td style="text-align:right;">5,000,000</td><td>사업비</td><td>학술 행사·연구지원</td><td style="text-align:right;">12,000,000</td></tr><tr><td>행사 수익</td><td>학술대회 참가비</td><td style="text-align:right;">3,000,000</td><td>관리비</td><td>서버·각종 수수료</td><td style="text-align:right;">1,000,000</td></tr><tr style="font-weight:700;background:#f0f0f0;"><td colspan="2">수입 합계</td><td style="text-align:right;color:#10b981;">20,000,000원</td><td colspan="2">지출 합계</td><td style="text-align:right;color:#ef4444;">17,000,000원</td></tr></tbody></table><div style="margin-top:8px;padding:10px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;border-radius:6px;">
